  "releaseNotes": "0.9.7.2 — Null-coalescing simplifications in terminal service internals; RoslynServiceFactory decoupled from WpfTerminal assembly (no Roslyn compile-time dependency for standalone consumers). No public API changes — drop-in upgrade from 0.9.7.1. 0.9.7.1 — +10 localizations (28 total); Terminal_Tab* keys backfilled. 0.9.7.0 — startup stability; scroll-bar theming; plugin error routing.",
